  "problem": "Researchers could not retain selected sources without an account. Duplicate clicks could duplicate a source. Stale generations could look current. Private notes could leak into enrichment or telemetry. Shortlist success could look like scientific suitability. A seventh result-card region could violate WP11.",
  "resulting_behavior": "Selected product/context IDs, generation and optional user-entered notes are stored locally. No credentials or source payloads enter local storage. Private notes are never automatically sent to enrichment or telemetry. Duplicate clicks do not duplicate a source. Stale entries retain their original context and offer explicit refresh. A user can select sources, navigate away, return and deliberately clear the list. Shortlist success does not mean the source is scientifically suitable. Exactly six data-result-region values remain. /workspace is not a primary navigation item. plan_research remains disabled. worker/index.mjs does not import enrichment. HTTP 200 is not a completed research task. Last-good generation live-2026-09-03-85b50522b420 is unchanged.",
